# A Ketra footman (KetraOrcSupport) that lists Raid Curse (4515, a debuff) and a Ketra ally of level 1
# who hits it: the footman petrifies the ally, its cast and the curse landing played by the reference
# server. The footman's combat draw is pinned so the curse lands, as the reference run's draw lets it.
# Expectations are the reference trace's (onAttacked).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/alliance_support_petrify_cast.golden
character Ally 40
standing 1
script script.feature.KetraOrcSupport
npc footman 21324 Monster 40 0 0 skill DEBUFF 4515 1
roll footman 0

hit footman 10
tick x3
  S MagicSkillUse caster=footman target=player skill=4515-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S SystemMessage id=110 4:4515,1
